{"page":604,"blocks":[{"x":0.04849,"y":0.05257,"w":0.33117,"h":0.01535,"fs":0.01535,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"590 Chapter 10: Infinite Sequences and Series"},{"x":0.32332,"y":0.09425,"w":0.59302,"h":0.04604,"fs":0.01279,"n":4,"k":1,"t":"Caution Remember that g(an + bn) can converge when gan and gbn both diverge. For example, gan = 1 + 1 + 1 + g and gbn = (-1) + (-1) + (-1) + g diverge, whereas g(an + bn) = 0 + 0 + 0 + gconverges to 0."},{"x":0.32332,"y":0.16229,"w":0.37133,"h":0.01449,"fs":0.01407,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"EXAMPLE 9 Find the sums of the following series."},{"x":0.37805,"y":0.18233,"w":0.10558,"h":0.03404,"fs":0.01279,"n":3,"k":0,"t":"3n-1 - 1 6n-1 = a"},{"x":0.48983,"y":0.18424,"w":0.02746,"h":0.02323,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"a 1"},{"x":0.49879,"y":0.18424,"w":0.09108,"h":0.03213,"fs":0.01279,"n":3,"k":0,"t":"2n-1 - 1 6n-1b"},{"x":0.32331,"y":0.19466,"w":0.05008,"h":0.01629,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"(a) a"},{"x":0.35441,"y":0.20879,"w":0.02065,"h":0.00916,"fs":0.0087,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"n=1"},{"x":0.46464,"y":0.20879,"w":0.02065,"h":0.00916,"fs":0.0087,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"n=1"},{"x":0.48828,"y":0.22474,"w":0.07305,"h":0.02872,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":0,"t":"1 2n-1 - a"},{"x":0.56598,"y":0.22474,"w":0.17632,"h":0.02872,"fs":0.01279,"n":3,"k":1,"t":"1 6n-1 Difference Rule"},{"x":0.44682,"y":0.23109,"w":0.0368,"h":0.01695,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"= a"},{"x":0.46464,"y":0.24587,"w":0.02065,"h":0.00916,"fs":0.0087,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"n=1"},{"x":0.54234,"y":0.24587,"w":0.02065,"h":0.00916,"fs":0.0087,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"n=1"},{"x":0.44682,"y":0.26183,"w":0.17888,"h":0.02801,"fs":0.01279,"n":5,"k":0,"t":"= 1 1 - (1>2) - 1 1 - (1>6)"},{"x":0.65868,"y":0.26216,"w":0.1308,"h":0.02558,"fs":0.01023,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"Geometric series with a = 1 and r = 1>2, 1>6"},{"x":0.44682,"y":0.29875,"w":0.05778,"h":0.01999,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":0,"t":"= 2 - 6"},{"x":0.49642,"y":0.29892,"w":0.04087,"h":0.02719,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":0,"t":"5 = 4 5"},{"x":0.37805,"y":0.32961,"w":0.06613,"h":0.